# 🚗⚡ IoT-Based EV Battery Management & Thermal Runaway Protection System

<p align="center">

  <h2 align="center">🔋 Smart EV Battery Thermal Management System</h2>

  <p align="center">
    <b>ESP32 • Embedded C++ • BMS • EV Thermal Management • IoT • Wokwi • Telegram</b>
